  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training Symposium - Transportation Security Administration, through National US Arab Chamber Of Commerce (Inc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) will support the travel of Indo-Pacific, Ukrainian, and Brazilian aviation security officials and airport representatives to attend the Transportation Security Administration (TSA) International Aviation Security Training Symposium in the United States. Subsequently, a related workshop to be held in the Indo-Pacific would serve as a follow-on event to the RTM and provide an opportunity to highlight U.S. leadership on key aviation security issues to Indo-Pacific participants. The RTM and workshop will familiarize delegates with TSA requirements, certification processes, and best practices and introduce delegates to U.S. aviation security technologies and their manufacturers.</narrative>
  </description>
